<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: Unload preserved food -->
  <APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.ManualUnload.Label>卸下保鲜食物</APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.ManualUnload.Label>
  <!-- EN: Choose a cell where Frostivus should unload all preserved food. Manually unloaded food will be forbidden. -->
  <APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.ManualUnload.Desc>选择霜语者卸下全部保鲜食物的格子。手动卸下的食物会被禁止拾取。</APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.ManualUnload.Desc>
  <!-- EN: No preserved food carried. -->
  <APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.ManualUnload.NoFood>未携带保鲜食物。</APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.ManualUnload.NoFood>
  <!-- EN: Frostivus cannot reach that cell. -->
  <APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.ManualUnload.NoPath>霜语者无法到达该格子。</APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.ManualUnload.NoPath>
  <!-- EN: Frostivus cannot use preservation commands right now. -->
  <APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.CommandUnavailable>霜语者当前无法使用保鲜指令。</APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.CommandUnavailable>
  <!-- EN: Release from cryo-chamber -->
  <APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.ReleaseDevoured.Label>从低温舱释放</APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.ReleaseDevoured.Label>
  <!-- EN: Choose a cell where Frostivus should release devoured pawns or corpses. -->
  <APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.ReleaseDevoured.Desc>选择霜语者释放被吞入的殖民者或尸体的格子。</APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.ReleaseDevoured.Desc>
  <!-- EN: No devoured pawn or corpse inside. -->
  <APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.ReleaseDevoured.NoContents>内部没有可释放的殖民者或尸体。</APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.ReleaseDevoured.NoContents>
  <!-- EN: Frostivus cannot reach that cell. -->
  <APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.ReleaseDevoured.NoPath>霜语者无法到达该格子。</APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.ReleaseDevoured.NoPath>
  <!-- EN: Frostivus can only swallow a spawned humanlike pawn or corpse on its map. -->
  <APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.CryptoSwallow.InvalidTarget>霜语者只能吞下其所在地图上已生成的类人生物或尸体。</APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.CryptoSwallow.InvalidTarget>
  <!-- EN: Frostivus can swallow any humanlike corpse or downed pawn, but only colonists, prisoners, or slaves while alive. -->
  <APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.CryptoSwallow.InvalidPawn>霜语者可吞下任意类人尸体或倒地的殖民者，但活体仅限殖民者、囚犯或奴隶。</APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.CryptoSwallow.InvalidPawn>
  <!-- EN: Frostivus cannot swallow itself. -->
  <APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.CryptoSwallow.Self>霜语者无法吞下自己。</APM.FrostivusFoodPreservation.CryptoSwallow.Self>

</LanguageData>
